# Hash-stable checkouts everywhere: lwpt's frozen install verifies the
# committed .lwpt/modules tree byte-for-byte, so Windows autocrlf must
# never rewrite text files. FPC is LF-happy on all platforms.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.tar.gz binary
*.zip binary
*.p12 binary

# Compiled WebAssembly fixtures. These are byte-exact by design — the
# decoder is asserted against their precise section offsets — so they must
# never go through text normalisation, whatever content heuristics guess.
*.wasm binary
